      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6427115::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting passivation film is enriched in Cr and Nb.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6427115::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr/Nb enrichment produces a more uniform and adherent passive film.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6427115::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr and Nb modify the native oxide chemistry and encourage a more stable and coherent passive film.",
