    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated Q235 steel forms an irregular oxide film with weak protective qualities.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr/Nb-treated Q235 steel will have a lower corrosion rate than untreated Q235 steel.",
